WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.632 --> 00:00:03.799
(light festive music)

00:00:08.061 --> 00:00:11.660
♪ Sisters, sisters ♪

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.232
♪ There were never such devoted sisters ♪

00:00:15.232 --> 00:00:18.811
♪ Never had to have a chaperon, no sir ♪

00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:22.429
♪ I'm here to keep my eye on her ♪

00:00:22.429 --> 00:00:25.941
♪ Caring, sharing ♪

00:00:25.941 --> 00:00:29.581
♪ Every little thing that we are wearing ♪

00:00:29.581 --> 00:00:33.101
♪ When a certain gentleman
arrived from Rome ♪

00:00:33.101 --> 00:00:36.731
♪ She wore the dress and I stayed home ♪

00:00:36.731 --> 00:00:38.451
♪ All kinds of weather ♪

00:00:38.451 --> 00:00:40.312
♪ We stick together ♪

00:00:40.312 --> 00:00:43.901
♪ The same in the rain or sun ♪

00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:45.611
♪ Two different faces ♪

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:47.411
♪ But in tight places ♪

00:00:47.411 --> 00:00:51.199
♪ We think and we act as one, ahah ♪

00:00:51.199 --> 00:00:54.640
♪ Those who've seen us ♪

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:58.280
♪ Know that not a thing
can come between us ♪

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:03.280
♪ Many men have tried to
split us up but no one can ♪

00:01:05.448 --> 00:01:08.792
♪ Lord, help the mister ♪

00:01:08.792 --> 00:01:12.160
♪ Who comes between me and my sister ♪

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.781
♪ And Lord, help the sister ♪

00:01:15.781 --> 00:01:19.611
♪ Who comes between me and my man ♪

00:01:19.611 --> 00:01:22.661
(light festive music)

00:01:22.661 --> 00:01:25.992
♪ Sisters ♪

00:01:25.992 --> 00:01:27.072
♪ Sisters ♪

00:01:27.072 --> 00:01:30.040
♪ Lord, help the mister ♪

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:33.649
♪ Who comes between me and my sister ♪

00:01:33.649 --> 00:01:37.200
♪ And Lord, help the sister ♪

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.230
♪ Who comes between me and my man ♪

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:44.411
♪ Sister, don't come
between me and my man ♪

00:01:44.411 --> 00:01:47.411
(audience cheering)

